version: 1.4.0
# v1.0.0 (commit 9734e32) predates the regex-to-tokenizer emissions parser
# rewrite. v1.1.0 added that rewrite. v1.2.0 added the idle/moving
# emissions split (parseEmissionSplitXML). v1.3.0 fixed the built-in
# vehicle-type emissionClass defaults (were HBEFA3 and, for three of
# seven types, a generic non-motorcycle-specific class). v1.4.0 is a
# correctness-fix round: GEH hourly-equivalent scaling, renamed GEH status
# labels, a TAG M3.1 rollup alongside the dashboard's own convention,
# signed MPE and a user-editable MAPE acceptance band, a coefficient
# display fix plus a linear-model alternative with adjusted R^2/AIC in the
# sensitivity module, named/sourced fuel-density constants with the
# idle/moving split now also fuel-type-split, an emissionClass-missing
# import warning, a vendored-library provenance manifest with a checksum
# test, and CI -- see CLAUDE.md's History section for the full account.
# v1.4.0 is the release described and verified in the paper.
# TODO (author): fill in once the v1.4.0 tag is pushed and a Zenodo DOI is
# minted for it -- see TODO_FOR_AUTHOR.md. Do not fabricate a DOI here in
# the meantime.
# doi: 10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX
date-released: '2026-09-01'
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    An Open Desktop Dashboard for SUMO Traffic Model Calibration,
    Validation, and Emissions Analysis
